// Beklenen: struct <-> skaler ve farkli struct'lar arasi akis reddedilmeli
// (plans/03 + plans/04 PR2, K061, 2026-09-27).
//
// TYPE_CUSTOM her `is_unknown` denetiminde muaf tutuluyordu ("struct alan
// tipleri izlenmiyor" — artik izleniyor). Olculen: bu dosya `tulpar
// typecheck`ten "ok" ile geciyordu ve --strict kosumu `int a = p;` icin
// ISARETCI DEGERINI (144840416), `abs(p)` icin 0 basiyordu.

// EXPECT: [typecheck]
// EXPECT: Type mismatch in declaration of 'a': expected int, got Nokta
// EXPECT: Argument 1 of 'f': expected int, got Nokta
// EXPECT: Argument 1 of 'abs': expected int or float, got Nokta
// EXPECT: Type mismatch in declaration of 'q': expected Nokta, got int
// EXPECT: Type mismatch in declaration of 'w': expected Nokta, got Renk
// EXPECT: Argument 1 of 'g': expected Nokta, got Renk
// EXPECT: Type mismatch in assignment to 'b': expected int, got Nokta

struct Nokta { float x; float y; }
struct Renk { int r; int g; }
func f(int a): int { return a + 1; }
func g(Nokta n): float { return n.x; }

Nokta p = { x: 1.0, y: 2.0 };
Renk k = { r: 1, g: 2 };
int a = p;
print(f(p));
print(abs(p));
Nokta q = 5;
Nokta w = k;
print(g(k));
int b = 0;
b = p;
